ears alone my husband and I have paid over {$30000.00} in mortgage payments. However our total balance went from a XXXX XXXX XXXX to XXXX XXXX $ after {$30000.00} in mortgage payments. We have been home almost 40 years and the mortgage lender stated that our home will still not be paid off for another 20 years.During this entire process my husband and I have made the mortgage payment every month principal balance and interest rate and the Total amount owed continues to grow and snowball out of control.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     